### 22. [The Inlaks Scholarship](https://inlaksfoundation.org/opportunities/scholarship/) : Inlaks Scholarship: A prestigious scholarship for exceptionally talented Indian graduates to pursue postgraduate study at leading institutions in the UK, Europe, and USA, with the aim of developing talent and enabling positive societal impact. It can provide up to US$120,000 toward tuition, living expenses, travel, visa and health costs.
Eligibility: Indian passport holder residing in India, generally ≤30 years, with a recognised Indian degree and minimum 65%/6.8 CGPA for humanities/social sciences/law or 70%/7.2 CGPA for science/environment-related fields; admission to the chosen institution is required before applying. Computer Science is currently excluded. 
